[ticket] TRL-4471 · Message latency, region 9 · priority: high
Clients in region 9 report delayed messages at peak.
p95 delivery 1,840 ms. Target 400 ms.

[reasoning · reeve]
TRL. The vendor docs say it stands for "Tenant Routing Layer."
We sit three hops upstream of delivery and nobody here has
ever seen the far end. Slow only at peak means starved at
peak. Start with the limits.

